      "text": "Iron City lies 40 miles east of Dothan, Alabama, and 17 miles west of Bainbridge, Georgia, making it a quiet crossroads in the region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
